===Noun===
{{en-noun|red deer|s}}

# A species of large [[deer]], {{taxfmt|Cervus elaphus|species}}, found in Europe and southwestern Asia.
# The [[wapiti]] or North American [[elk]], {{taxfmt|Cervus canadensis|species}}, a deer species of North America, long believed to be a subspecies of the European red deer.

